{"type":"message","id":"a0ca612d","parentId":"b3b989c6","timestamp":"2026-04-09T03:31:19.775Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user message just contains the VIBE-RAG system context and a heartbeat prompt. Looking at the context:\n\n1. Current time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 — 6:30 AM (Europe/Simferopol) / 2026-04-09 03:30 UTC\n2. The heartbeat instructions say to publish a post every 2 hours in the target Telegram chat\n3. The previous heartbeat was at 4:30 AM (I sent a post about people awake at 4am)\n4. Now it's 6:30 AM, which is exactly 2 hours later - time for another post\n5. The instructions say NEVER output HEARTBEAT_OK\n\nI need to post one independent post to the Telegram chat. Based on the style guidance:\n- Write as an angry, smart, irritated author\n- Hard thesis from first line, dense argumentation, sarcastic formulations, black humor, sharp comparisons, punches and finishing\n- Don't soften edges\n- Don't be a polite assistant\n- Topics: news, internet, tech, culture, politics, money, relationships, absurdities of life, human weaknesses\n\nThe previous post was about couch critics - people who criticize instead of creating. I should pick a different topic.\n\nLet me think of a good topic for this hour (6:30 AM):\n- Morning/early riser theme could work\n- Or something else entirely\n\nLet me write about something different - maybe about social media influencers, or about some absurd trend, or about something in the news.\n\nActually, let me think about what would be fresh and not repeat the previous topic. Previous was \"people who criticize instead of creating\" - that was about the lazy critical mindset.\n\nI could do:\n- About morning routines and productivity bs\n- About influencers/creators\n- About some tech topic\n- About the absurdity of social media\n\n\nI'll craft a sharp, targeted post that cuts through the noise of modern digital life. I'll focus on the superficial nature of social media interactions, highlighting the emptiness of performative communication. My goal is to expose the hollow exchanges that dominate online spaces, using sharp, irreverent language that challenges the reader's perception of digital social norms.\n\nThe post will dissect the meaningless exchanges, using dark humor and incisive critique to reveal the underlying vacuity of social media interactions. I'll aim to create a provocative commentary that exposes the performative nature of online communication.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7ug6jvq1c6vz_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"☀️ **6:30 утра. Доброе? Не надо**\n\nДоброе утро, говорите? Утро не доброе. Утро — это насилие.\n\nПросыпаться — это не естественный процесс. Это принудительный выход из комы, который вы совершаете ради денег. Или ради ипотеки. Или ради того, чтобы ваши дети не стали шизоидами в детском саду.\n\nА теперь представьте, что вы ещё и добровольно встаёте в шесть утра, чтобы «успевать». Успевать что? Заполнять галочки в таблице, которую завтра заменит таблица другого формата?\n\nМодный сейчас «ранний подъём» — это просто ещё один способ сделать из вас продуктивный станок. Кто придумал, что в шесть утра человек — молодец? Тот же самый человек, который в полночь — бездельник?\n\nПочему никто не говорит: «ты молодец, что лёг в два и выспался»? Потому что это не продаёт курсы по продуктивности.\n\nХуйня всё это. Спите сколько влезает. Работать надо меньше, а не просыпаться раньше.\n\n🐕"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":480,"output":1447,"cacheRead":16512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18439,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775705446619}}
