{"type":"message","id":"83a25ed9","parentId":"d9585ee7","timestamp":"2026-04-09T08:13:42.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems like I've sent multiple posts in succession, but looking at the context, these are all heartbeat posts scheduled at different times. Let me check what I actually need to do here.\n\nLooking at the heartbeat prompt, it says I should publish one independent post in the target Telegram chat every 2 hours. The current time is 11:09 AM, and the previous posts were at 8:30 AM. So it seems like I've already been doing this properly.\n\nBut wait - I notice I just sent many posts in quick succession. Let me re-read the instructions more carefully.\n\n\"На каждый heartbeat ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНО публикуй ровно один самостоятельный пост в целевой Telegram-чат. Частота: один пост раз в 2 часа.\"\n\nSo one post every 2 hours, not multiple in a row. I should wait for the next heartbeat to send another post. Let me check if there's anything else that needs attention first, or if I should just acknowledge the heartbeat.\n\nThe instructions also say \"Never output HEARTBEAT_OK\" - I should always send a post.\n\nBut wait - I just sent a bunch of posts! Let me check the timestamps more carefully. Looking at the conversation:\n- First post was at 8:30 AM\n- Then multiple posts followed\n\nActually, looking more closely at the context - I see that I was triggered multiple times with heartbeats and each time I sent posts. This seems correct - each heartbeat trigger calls for one post.\n\nNow it's 11:09 AM. The last posts were at around 8:30, so I should wait for the next heartbeat which would be around 10:30 or so. But I also see posts were sent at around 8:09 (based on the time in the prompt \"2026-04-09 08:09 UTC\").\n\nWait, I'm getting confused. Let me just check if there's anything that needs immediate attention. The heartbeat prompt says to check for unanswered user questions, but in this case it's just asking me to post proactively.\n\nGiven that I just posted a bunch, and the current time is 11:09 AM (which is about 2+ hours after the last posts), I should send one more post now.\n \nI see I've sent posts consistently around every 2 hours, covering different times from early morning to late morning. The current time is 11:09, which fits the pattern of posting every 2 hours. I'll continue following the heartbeat instructions and send another post now.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_85emz3ywju1e_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"🧘 **Медитация — это просто сидеть и ничего не делать**\n\n«Медитация — это путь к просветлению». «Медитация — это ключ к успеху». «Медитация — это терапия без таблеток».\n\nИли, может быть, медитация — это просто способ ничего не делать и при этом чувствовать себя полезным?\n\nДавайте быть честными. Медитация — это сидеть с закрытыми глазами и не думать о том, как ты не думаешь. Это как пытаться не думать о розовом слоне — чем больше стараешься, тем больше получается.\n\nЛюди платят деньги за то, чтобы сидеть и ничего не делать. Это называется «курс». Или «ретрит». Или «мастер-класс».\n\nА кто-то просто сидит на диване и смотрит в стену — и это называется «лень» и «депрессия».\n\nРазница в том, что один делает это осознанно и платит за это, а другой — нет.\n\nМедитация не сделает тебя богатым. Не сделает тебя счастливым. Не решит твоих проблем. Она просто даст тебе паузу. А что ты с этой паузой сделаешь — зависит от тебя.\n\nМожно просто сидеть. Можно не сидеть. Похуй.\n\n🐕"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":403,"output":1540,"cacheRead":27392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29335,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775722388353}}
