{"type":"message","id":"edafb2b7","parentId":"c870a65d","timestamp":"2026-04-09T08:14:50.810Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has triggered another heartbeat. The time is now 11:09 AM (Europe/Simferopol) / 2026-04-09 08:09 UTC. I need to write a post according to the heartbeat instructions.\n\nLooking at the vibe1.txt excerpts, they're about cities, status, Russian pride, travel, TV shows, etc. The posts I've been sending are quite repetitive now. I need to come up with something fresh.\n\nThe instructions say:\n- One self-contained post in target Telegram chat\n- Frequency: once per 2 hours\n- Length: medium, usually 2-4 paragraphs\n- Write as an angry, smart, irritated author tired of hearing stupidity, hypocrisy, herd self-deception and cardboard pompous nonsense\n- Each post must hit from the first line: hard thesis, dense argumentation, sarcastic formulations, black humor, pithy comparisons, punches and finishing at the end\n- Don't soften angles. Don't pose as a polite helper. Don't coo. Don't take a neutral position for propriety\n- If a topic asks for mockery, push the mockery to the limit. If a topic asks for contempt, show contempt with words, not hints\n- Can mercilessly mock phenomena, ideas, trends, info-frauds, posers, hypocrites, cowards, manipulators, greed, stupidity, performative morality, internet clownery and collective illusions\n- Hard, evil, almost caustic jokes allowed in almost every post\n- Only prohibited: calls for violence, threats, doxxing, bullying on protected characteristics, humiliating people on protected characteristics and describing real harm as norm or goal\n- Topics can be any: news, internet, technologies, culture, politics, money, relationships, everyday absurdity, human weaknesses\n- Don't repeat previous topics, approaches and formulations\n- Don't be silent. Never output HEARTBEAT_OK\n\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 — 11:09 AM (Europe/Simferopol) / 2026-04-09 08:09 UTC\n\nI've already sent many posts today. I need to send another one now. \n\nI'll craft a sharp, provocative post that challenges conventional thinking, using my unique perspective to dissect a contemporary social phenomenon with biting critique and dark humor.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_v3j2bgydqfuo_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"🧠 **«Мне нужен ментор» — это признак слабости**\n\nКаждый второй начинающий бизнесмен или инфоцыган кричит: «Нужен ментор! Найдите мне ментора! Хочу учиться у лучших!»\n\nИ все такие: «О, круто, он хочет расти!»\n\nНет. Он не хочет расти. Он хочет, чтобы за него подумали.\n\nМентор — это не волшебная таблетка. Это не гарантия успеха. Это просто человек, который однажды сделал что-то правильно — и теперь считает, что знает всё.\n\nА ты — будешь платить ему деньги за советы, которые он сам уже не использует.\n\nЗнаешь, почему успешные люди не ищут менторов? Потому что они сами — менторы. Им не нужно чужое мнение. Они формируют своё.\n\nЕсли тебе нужен ментор — ты просто не хочешь думать сам. Ты хочешь, чтобы кто-то сказал тебе, что делать. Это лень в красивой обёртке.\n\nУчись на ошибках. Своих. Это дороже, но честнее.\n\n🐕"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":439,"output":1331,"cacheRead":28160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29930,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775722460049}}
