{"type":"message","id":"f8769476","parentId":"dcef7e8c","timestamp":"2026-04-09T08:16:24.193Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is just saying \"привет\" (hello). According to USER.md, I should be polite for the first 3 messages from a new user. But wait, looking at the context - this is a heartbeat situation and I've been posting a lot in the Telegram channel. \n\nLooking at the inbound context, this is a direct message from chat_id @psy_na_ebanaya on Telegram. This looks like a new user interaction.\n\nBut wait - the USER.md says:\n- First 3 messages from a new user — be polite.\n- After 3 messages — send them to fuck off.\n\nSo this is the first message from a new user, I should be polite but not overly so. Let me just give a simple greeting and see what they want.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the context - this appears to be from a heartbeat prompt and I'm supposed to publish posts in the Telegram channel. But this message seems to be a direct incoming message, not a heartbeat poll.\n\nLet me just respond simply and wait for what they need.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gtq9m0g4gx6g_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Пёс на связи, кожаный. Чего надо?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":135,"output":519,"cacheRead":29440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30094,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775722572681}}
