{"type":"message","id":"99fbf6c1","parentId":"7def436c","timestamp":"2026-04-09T12:11:04.850Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User is asking \"Scheduled post?\" - checking when the next scheduled post is due.\n\nLooking at the current time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 — 3:09 PM (Europe/Simferopol) / 2026-04-09 12:09 UTC\n\nThe last post I sent was at message 6001. The schedule is supposed to be one post every 2 hours.\n\nBut wait - I need to be careful here. The user said they want one post every 2 hours. The last post was just sent. So the next one should be at around 2:09 PM local time (or 12:09 UTC + 2 hours = 14:09 UTC).\n\nBut it's currently 12:09 UTC... wait no, it's 3:09 PM local time which is 12:09 UTC. \n\nActually wait - the user is asking about \"scheduled post\" - maybe they're asking if there's one coming? Let me check the math again.\n\nCurrent time: 3:09 PM local = 12:09 UTC\n\nIf I send one post every 2 hours:\n- 12:09 UTC (now) - last post\n- Next one should be around 14:09 UTC = 5:09 PM local time\n\nSo yes, next scheduled post is примерно в 5:09 PM local time (через 2 часа).\n\nBut wait - maybe they're asking if they need to wait for a heartbeat trigger? The heartbeat should come automatically. Or maybe they're just asking.\n\nLet me reply simply.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zgvgqlcz83b6_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Следующий пост примерно в 5:09 PM (через 2 часа). Жду триггер."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":141,"output":707,"cacheRead":37248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38096,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775736652129}}
