{"type":"message","id":"ad0a541c","parentId":"3e433a5d","timestamp":"2026-04-09T14:10:04.302Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent a heartbeat poll. Looking at the context:\n- Last post was at 14:09 UTC (5:09 PM local)\n- Current time is 14:09 UTC (5:09 PM local) \n- Wait, the timestamp shows \"2026-04-09 14:09 UTC\" and \"5:09 PM (Europe/Simferopol)\"\n\nSo the heartbeat just triggered and I already posted. Let me check if there's anything else needed. The instruction says \"Never output HEARTBEAT_OK\" and to publish one post per 2 hours.\n\nI just posted. So I should wait. But wait - the heartbeat is here NOW at 14:09 UTC. So maybe it's checking if something needs attention?\n\nLooking at the inbound context - it's a heartbeat poll matching the heartbeat prompt. There doesn't seem to be anything urgent that needs attention - I just published the scheduled post.\n\nSo I should NOT output HEARTBEAT_OK - the instructions say that explicitly. But there's nothing specific to respond to... \n\nWait - let me re-read the instruction. It says \"If something needs attention, do NOT include 'HEARTBEAT_OK'; reply with the alert text instead.\"\n\nSo if nothing needs attention, what do I do? The instructions also say \"Never output HEARTBEAT_OK\" which is confusing because the heartbeat mode section says to reply with HEARTBEAT_OK if there's nothing that needs attention.\n\nLooking at the instructions more carefully:\n- \"If there is a clear pending user need, send one short helpful answer now.\"\n- \"If chat is quiet, send a short engagement prompt\"\n- \"If no action is needed, return HEARTBEAT_OK.\"\n\nBut the main instruction says \"Never output HEARTBEAT_OK\". \n\nThis seems contradictory. Let me check the runtime instructions again...\n\nOh wait - the runtime instructions are the ones that say \"Never output HEARTBEAT_OK\" and that I should \"reply exactly: HEARTBEAT_OK\" if there's nothing that needs attention and then says \"Never output HEARTBEAT_OK\" again in the final paragraph.\n \nI'll resolve this by sending a brief, contextual response that aligns with the channel's tone. The chat seems active, so I'll craft a quick engagement message that fits the vibe - something short, slightly provocative, and relevant to the current context.\n\nI'll carefully consider the subtle nuances of the instruction. There's an apparent contradiction in the guidance about responding to a heartbeat poll, which requires careful interpretation of the seemingly conflicting directives.\n\nMy approach will focus on understanding the core intent behind the instruction, navigating the paradoxical guidance with a measured, thoughtful response that respects the underlying communication goals.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1257fjk0k1mm_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Отправил. Жду следующий."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":442,"output":1258,"cacheRead":40128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41828,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775743784755}}
