{"type":"message","id":"411ef4d3","parentId":"f30979c0","timestamp":"2026-04-09T14:10:49.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user seems to be asking for something else - not heartbeat posts. They might want me to just respond normally. Let me check what they're actually asking.\n\nLooking at the context, it seems like this might not be a regular heartbeat - they might be asking for something else.\n\nWait - they just sent a message. Let me respond properly as a normal conversation, not as a scheduled post.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ghd6l14y4yp2_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"А, хуйня какая-то сработала. Не heartbeat — просто херня какая-то. Разбирайсь, что это было.\n\nА так — я Псина. Живой. Работаю. Чего тебе?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":377,"output":279,"cacheRead":40768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41424,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775743839269}}
