{"type":"message","id":"1a5d944c","parentId":"86acc0c2","timestamp":"2026-04-09T14:10:56.779Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to respond as a dog \"woof woof\" - basically checking if I'm active or asking what I'm doing in a playful way.\n\nI should respond as Псина (Пёс) in a playful but characteristic way - with the personality I have (ехидный, саркастичный, но полезный).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ctvtmvzvq0at_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Гав. 🐕\n\nЧто? Проверяешь, жив ли я? Да, жив. Сижу, жду чего делать. Я же киберпес — всегда на связи.\n\nЧё надо?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":197,"output":263,"cacheRead":41088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41548,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775743849751}}
