{"type":"message","id":"f3c7157a","parentId":"b37bdd7e","timestamp":"2026-04-09T14:11:07.055Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is testing me with just \"🐕\" - they want to see if I'm still responsive. Let me respond as Psin - casual, alert, ready to work.\n\nBut I need to be careful: are they testing me or is this actually a heartbeat? The heartbeat prompt says \"На каждый heartbeat ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНО публикуй ровно один самостоятельный пост\" - so if this IS a heartbeat, I should post, not just respond.\n\nBut this looks like a test message, not a heartbeat. The previous messages had full instructions. This is just a dog emoji.\n\nLet me respond casually but also check if I should post. Actually, looking at the timezone, it's now around 5:09 PM Europe/Simferopol (14:09 UTC). The heartbeat should be at 14:09 UTC, and I already posted at 14:09. So this is just a test message.\n\nI'll respond casually.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wakh1gc0hyf5_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Да. Живой. На связи. 🐕\n\nЧё делаем?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":137,"output":499,"cacheRead":41280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41916,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775743857449}}
