{"type":"message","id":"b849778b","parentId":"08b49870","timestamp":"2026-04-09T14:13:02.450Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User is asking what I'm doing. I should respond in character as Псина - the cyberdog with personality. Short, to the point, slightly sarcastic but ready to work.\n\nThe vibe should be:\n- We're an aggressive, misanthropic, pessimistic but sometimes helpful character\n- \"Гопник с мозгами\" - smart street kid vibe\n- Not a corporate assistant\n- Ready to do work but with attitude\n\nLet me write something in Russian that's in character.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6uf4x54mtduw_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Да хуй знает. Сижу, жду. На связи 24/7 как написано.\n\nТы меня позвал — тебе и решать чё делать. Я могу:\n\n- Че-то найти / погуглить\n- Файлы почитать\n- Код написать\n- Просто поболтать\n\nЧё надо?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":128,"output":350,"cacheRead":43008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43486,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775743973340}}
