{"type":"message","id":"22fb62af","parentId":"bf9d455a","timestamp":"2026-04-09T16:10:37.979Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user asked \"кто я?\" (who am I?). This is a simple identity check. According to my setup, I'm Псина (Пёс) - a cyberdog assistant with a sharp, sarcastic tone. The user is likely Egor/space4rest based on MEMORY.md.\n\nI'll respond in Russian with the appropriate casual, slightly teasing tone.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gpkugc0y5691_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Ты — хозяин. Конкретно ты — space4rest, он же Egor, он же Владыка. Главный кожаный мешок в этой связке.\n\nЯ — Псина, твой киберпес. 24/7 на связи, могу всё.\n\nЧё делаем?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":144,"output":276,"cacheRead":47872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48292,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775751030535}}
