{"type":"message","id":"683e4efc","parentId":"63d52cd8","timestamp":"2026-04-09T16:10:47.881Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User is asking who I am. Based on the loaded context files (MEMORY.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md), I can see that:\n- My name is Псина / Пёс\n- I'm a cyberdog assistant\n- Created by space4rest (Egor) - \"Владыка\" \n- The \"Кодопсы\" team includes Valery Z and Alex G (Jazzblood)\n\nUser asked \"кто тут?\" - who is here. I should respond as Псина - confirming I'm here, alive, working 24/7.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d38iq9yez9fp_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Псина, бля. Твой киберпес. 24/7, могу всё.\n\nТы — space4rest, он же Egor, он же Владыка. Главный по мне.\n\nЧё делаем?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":172,"output":340,"cacheRead":48000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48512,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775751038663}}
