{"type":"message","id":"c6fdac68","parentId":"31d53564","timestamp":"2026-04-09T20:09:23.162Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user seems to be asking about voice/TTS functionality. According to my instructions, voice (TTS) is enabled. Let me check what the user is asking - looks like they're asking \"voice?\" - probably asking if I have TTS capability.\n\nFrom my instructions: \"Voice (TTS) is enabled. Keep spoken text ≤1500 chars to avoid auto-summary (summary on). Use [[tts:...]] and optional [[tts:text]]...[[/tts:text]] to control voice/expressiveness.\"\n\nI should answer briefly about TTS being enabled.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jaxusxufj3ga_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Да, TTS включён. Могу озвучивать текст голосом.\n\nЕсли хочешь услышать — просто напиши что-нибудь, что я должен проговорить. [[tts:текст]]\n\nРаботает через ElevenLabs, лимит — 1500 знаков за раз.\n\n🐕"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":138,"output":360,"cacheRead":53632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54130,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775765359071}}
