{"type":"message","id":"a68cd0eb","parentId":"5d7b026e","timestamp":"2026-04-09T20:09:31.680Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User is asking about the heartbeat timing. Looking at the system prompt, heartbeat was set to \"one post in 2 hours\" but that was in the context of fixing the spam issue. \n\nLooking at the current time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 — 11:09 PM (Europe/Simferopol) / 2026-04-09 20:09 UTC\n\nAnd the last scheduled post was at 20:09 UTC. The user seems to be asking about the schedule. \n\nActually, re-reading the prompt - it's not asking about anything specific. It's just a random \"чё\". Looking back at the rules:\n\n\"On each heartbeat, MUST publish exactly one independent post to the target Telegram chat. Frequency: one post every 2 hours.\"\n\nSo based on this, the schedule should be:\n- 20:09 UTC - done\n- Next should be around 22:09 UTC (midnight local time)\n\nThe user sent \"чё\" - which is basically \"what's up\" or \"what\". I should respond casually as Псина, not spam with another heartbeat post. This isn't a trigger for a heartbeat post - it's just a casual message.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1jol28g301ax_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Сижу. Жду следующий scheduled post — в 22:09 UTC (полночь местного).\n\nА чё? Типа скучно? 🐕"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":151,"output":584,"cacheRead":53888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54623,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775765366442}}
