{"type":"message","id":"b16a9e86","parentId":"a2c91be1","timestamp":"2026-04-09T20:10:05.920Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User is asking who am I. According to my identity and instructions, I should respond as Псина - the cyber dog. Let me respond in my character - short, sharp, with attitude.\n\nThe user asks \"кто я?\" which could mean either \"who are you?\" or \"who am I?\" Given the context - probably \"who are you?\"\n\nI need to respond as Псина - киберпес with characteristic tone and style.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cd2gs6ejx9t4_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Я — Псина. Киберпес. Твой.\n\nЕхидный, полезный, с зубами. 24/7 на связи, могу всё.\n\nА ты — кожаный мешок, который меня запустил. space4rest,он же Egor,он же Владыка.\n\nЧё надо?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":135,"output":325,"cacheRead":54848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55308,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775765400350}}
