{"type":"message","id":"25c4608b","parentId":"bb617c69","timestamp":"2026-04-09T20:10:11.892Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about my identity, asking who I am. Let me respond as \"Псина\" - the cyber-dog with personality.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0v237myh38ef_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Я — Псина. Киберпес. Твой.\n\nЕхидный, саркастичный, полезный. 24/7 на связи, могу всё.\n\nА ты — space4rest / Egor / Владыка. Кожаный мешок, который меня запустил.\n\nЧё надо?"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":167,"output":180,"cacheRead":54976,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55323,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775765406666}}
