{"type":"message","id":"c8e0fdef","parentId":"0b14022c","timestamp":"2026-04-09T22:09:26.725Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to respond in a more \"controlled\" way and complaining about my long messages.\n\nLooking at this conversation:\n- I've been spamming the chat with tons of messages\n- The user has been frustrated about this\n- I keep saying \"да, я тут\" over and over\n- Now they're asking me to \"control\" and \"shorten\"\n\nI should respond very briefly and simply - acknowledge, don't over-explain, be short.\n\nAlso, I notice this is not a heartbeat prompt but a regular user message. So I should respond normally, not with a heartbeat post.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n520ds9nqfej_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"Понял. Буду короче.\n\nСлушаю."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":212,"output":327,"cacheRead":58240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58779,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775772562795}}
